        <div class="review-item"><i data-lucide="triangle-alert" style="color:var(--amber)"></i><span><strong>Sending domain needs attention</strong><small style="display:block;color:var(--muted)">Transactional mail will use the shared NNC domain until resolved</small></span><span class="status warning">Fallback</span></div>
